pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 36, 300, 20]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: OUTCOMES
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 60, 700, 44]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 学生能带走什么
  - elementId: title-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 112, 832, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: o1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 150, 250, 64]
    content:
      fontSize: 50
      color: "$accent"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: "3"
  - elementId: o1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [110, 162, 200, 40]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 种语言基础
  - elementId: o1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 222, 250, 90]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>Python、HTML、JavaScript 各入门，知道它们分别适合做什么。</p>
  - elementId: o1-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 136, 250, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: o2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [368, 150, 250, 64]
    content:
      fontSize: 50
      color: "$accent"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 6+
  - elementId: o2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [446, 162, 170, 40]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 个项目作品
  - elementId: o2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [368, 222, 250, 90]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>聊天机器人、猜数字、消消乐、个人主页、打地鼠……组成自己的作品集。</p>
  - elementId: o2-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [368, 136, 250, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: o3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [672, 150, 250, 64]
    content:
      fontSize: 50
      color: "$cyan"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: "1"
  - elementId: o3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [718, 162, 178, 40]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 套 AI 协作思维
  - elementId: o3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [672, 222, 224, 90]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>把想法说清楚、把任务拆小、验收 AI 的结果 —— 未来通用的能力。</p>
  - elementId: o3-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [672, 136, 224, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$cyan"}
  - elementId: bottom-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 348, 832, 110]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$panel"}
  - elementId: bottom-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [96, 382, 42, 42]
    iconName: "fas:graduation-cap"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: bottom-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [160, 372, 712, 76]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>8 次课结束后，每个学生都能说：</p>
        <p><span style="color:$cyan">"我有一个想法，我能让 AI 帮我把它做出来。"</span></p>
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 500, 64, 20]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 13 / 15
